<title>USA: BDM International sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>BDM International sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, Va. 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>BDM International Inc  said Friday it has declared a 2-for-1 stock split in the form of a stock dividend payable March 20 to shareholders of record March 6.</p>
<p>The company also said that at its annual meeting, set for May 9, it would ask shareholders for approval to increase the number of authorized shares from 50 million to 100 million.</p>
</text>
